1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:02,099
There is a hard lump molded around your laptop

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,259
charger cable, and it is surprisingly heavy

3
00:00:04,339 --> 00:00:04,939
for its size.

4
00:00:05,219 --> 00:00:06,779
Inside it is a ring of ferrite,

5
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,179
an iron-based ceramic.

6
00:00:08,439 --> 00:00:10,479
A power cable is a long piece of wire,

7
00:00:10,719 --> 00:00:12,319
and a long piece of wire is an antenna,

8
00:00:12,619 --> 00:00:14,579
so it picks up and radiates high-frequency

9
00:00:14,679 --> 00:00:16,000
noise it was never meant to carry.

10
00:00:16,199 --> 00:00:18,319
The ferrite ring lets your actual power pass

11
00:00:18,399 --> 00:00:20,319
straight through, and turns that noise into

12
00:00:20,379 --> 00:00:21,379
a tiny amount of heat.

13
00:00:21,639 --> 00:00:23,319
It is a filter wrapped around a cable,

14
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,179
stopping your charger from transmitting.
